{"id":16,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Very docile. If attacked, it will often kick up sand to protect itself rather than fight back."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Pidgey has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It is capable of unerringly returning home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"A common sight in forests and woods. It flaps its wings at ground level to kick up blinding sand."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Common in grassy areas and forests, it is very docile and will chase off enemies by flapping up sand."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It usually hides in tall grass. Because it dislikes fighting, it protects itself by kicking up sand."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"Does not like to fight. It hides in tall grass and so on, foraging for food such as small bugs."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It can unerringly return home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It rapidly flaps its wings in the grass, stirring up a dust cloud that drives insect prey out into the open."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Tangled Feet","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness if it is confused."},{"name":"Big Pecks","hidden":true,"description":"Prevents the Pokémon from having its Defense stat lowered."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolu